{"G1449":{"id":"G1449","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1449","disambiguated_id":"G1449 =","unique_id":"G1449","headword":"ἐγγράφω","transliteration":"engraphō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to write in","definition_en":"1. to mark in or on, to paint on , (Herdotus Historicus) \n2. to inscribe, write in or on , (Herdotus Historicus):—;Pass., ἐγγεγραμμένος τι having something written on it, (Sophocles Tragicus); so Virgil flores inscripti nomina. \n3. to enter in the public register , ἐγγρ. τὸν υἱὸν εἰς ἄνδρας (Demosthenes Orator):—;Pass., εἰς τοὺς δημότας ἐγγραφῆναι (Demosthenes Orator) \n4. to enter on the judge's list, to indict , (Aristophanes Comicus) (ML)","source_line":1581}],"occurrence_count":3,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"escrita","count":2},{"gloss":"estarem-escritos","count":1}]},"G2024":{"id":"G2024","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2024","disambiguated_id":"G2024 =","unique_id":"G2024","headword":"ἐπιχορηγία","transliteration":"epichorēgia","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"supply","definition_en":"ἐπι-χορηγία, -ας, ἡ\n (ἐπιχορηγέω), \na supply: Eph.4:16, Php.1:19.† \n (AS)","source_line":2165}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"ligamentos","count":1},{"gloss":"socorro","count":1}]},"G2341":{"id":"G2341","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2341","disambiguated_id":"G2341 =","unique_id":"G2341","headword":"θηριομαχέω","transliteration":"thēriomacheō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to fight beasts","definition_en":"θηριομαχέω, -ῶ\n (θηρίον, μάχομαι), \nto fight with wild beasts (Diod., al.): 1Co.15:32.†\n (AS)","source_line":2490}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"lutei-contra-feras","count":1}]},"G2427":{"id":"G2427","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2427","disambiguated_id":"G2427 =","unique_id":"G2427","headword":"ἱκανόω","transliteration":"hikanoō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to qualify","definition_en":"ἱκανόω, -ῶ\n (ἱκανός), [in LXX chiefly for רַב ;] \nto make sufficient, render fit: with dupl. accusative, 2Co.3:6; with accusative of person(s) before εἰς, Col.1:12.†\n (AS)","source_line":2584}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"fez","count":1},{"gloss":"capacitou","count":1}]},"G268":{"id":"G268","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0268","disambiguated_id":"G0268 =","unique_id":"G0268","headword":"ἁμαρτωλός","transliteration":"hamartōlos","lexical_morphology":"G:A","gloss_en":"sinful","definition_en":"ἁμαρτωλός, -όν\n (ἁμαρτάνω), [in LXX chiefly for רָשָׁע ;] \nsinful, a sinner: of all men, 1Ti.1:15; of those especially wicked, 1Ti.1:9, 1Pe.4:18; p1., Mat.9:10-13 11:19 26:45, al. (see MM, VGT, see word; Cremer, 102, 634) \n (AS)","source_line":371}],"occurrence_count":47,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"pecadores","count":32},{"gloss":"pecador","count":11},{"gloss":"pecadora","count":3},{"gloss":"pecaminoso","count":1}]},"G2739":{"id":"G2739","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2739","disambiguated_id":"G2739 =","unique_id":"G2739","headword":"καυματίζω","transliteration":"kaumatizō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to scorch","definition_en":"καυματίζω\n (καῦμα), \nto burn or scorch up: with accusative before ἐν πυρί, Rev.16:8. Pass., Mat.13:14, Mrk.4:6; before καῦμα μέγα, Rev.16:9.†\n (AS)","source_line":2929}],"occurrence_count":4,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"queimou","count":2},{"gloss":"queimasse","count":1},{"gloss":"foram-queimados","count":1}]},"G2906":{"id":"G2906","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2906","disambiguated_id":"G2906 =","unique_id":"G2906","headword":"κραυγή","transliteration":"kraugē","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"shouting","definition_en":"κραυγή, -ῆς, ἡ \n [in LXX for צְוָחָה, תְּרוּעָה, שַׁוְעָה, etc. ;] \ncrying, outcry, clamour: Mat.25:6, Luk.1:42, Act.23:9, Eph.4:31, Heb.5:7, Rev.21:4.†\n (AS)","source_line":3101}],"occurrence_count":6,"observed_portuguese_