and ICC, in l), 2Pe.2:15. \n __2. Generally, reward: Jhn.4:36, 1Co.9:18; esp. of divine rewards, Mat.5:12 6:1-2, 5 6:16 10:41-42 Mrk.9:41, Luk.6:23, 35, 1Co.3:8 3:14, 2Jn.8, Rev.11:18 22:12; ἔχειν μ., Mat.5:46, 1Co.9:17.†\n (AS)","source_line":3521}],"occurrence_count":29,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"recompensa","count":18},{"gloss":"salário","count":4},{"gloss":"pagamento","count":4},{"gloss":"permanecer-recompensa","count":1},{"gloss":"por-salário","count":1},{"gloss":"dares-recompensa","count":1}]},"G3619":{"id":"G3619","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3619","disambiguated_id":"G3619 =","unique_id":"G3619","headword":"οἰκοδομή","transliteration":"oikodomē","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"building","definition_en":"οἰκοδομή, -ῆς, ἡ\n (οἶκος, + δέμω, to build), [in LXX: 1Ch.29:1 A (בִּירָה), Eze.17:17 40:2 (בָּנָה, מִבְנֶה), Sir.22:16 40:19, al. ;] \n= cl. οἰκοδομία (which see), -δόμησις (Thuc., Plat.), \n __1. the act of building; in NT always metaphorically, building up, edifying: Rom.14:19 15:2, 1Co.14:26, 2Co.10:8 13:10, Eph.4:29; with genitive obj., 1Co.14:12, 2Co.12:19, Eph.4:12, 16; λαλεῖν, λαβεῖν, οἰ., 1Co.14:3. \n __2. = οἰκοδόμημα, a building: Mat.24:1, Mrk.13:1-2; metaphorically, 1Co.3:9, 2Co.5:1, Eph.2:21.†\n (AS)","source_line":3734}],"occurrence_count":18,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"edificação","count":12},{"gloss":"edifício","count":3},{"gloss":"edifícios","count":2},{"gloss":"edifícios-complexo","count":1}]},"G3790":{"id":"G3790","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3790","disambiguated_id":"G3790 =","unique_id":"G3790","headword":"ὀφρῦς","transliteration":"ophrus","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"brow","definition_en":"ὀφρύς -ύος, ἡ\n [in LXX: Lev.14:9 (עַיִן גַב) * ;] \nan eyebrow, the brow of a hill: Luk.4:29.†\n (AS)","source_line":3908}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"topo","count":1}]},"G3912":{"id":"G3912","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3912",